invariant: INV-64
file: srv_ticket.c
catches: cnsa2_server_test
reason: the profile's server seals its tickets under ChaCha20-Poly1305,
  the cipher CNSA 2.0 does not name. test_ticket opens the sealed body
  with gcm_traffic_open on a key it expands itself, and requires it to
  open.

--- old
    gcm_traffic_seal(&k, nonce, ticket_version, sizeof ticket_version, pt, n, ct, tag);
--- new
    aead_seal(widemul, key, nonce, ticket_version, sizeof ticket_version, pt, n, ct, tag);
